parts.text:
Now replace the game-end/save/calcRank/saveBest* block with the new logic. New mapping:
- 1=繁殖 (isBr): save bestBr (score)
- 2=极限 (isExt): save bestExt (score)
- 3=血量 (isHp): save bestHp (score)
- 4=狂野 (isWild): save bestWild (time, lower better)

Also addRun on every end (win or over). calcRank only computes calories + addRun + updateBest.

Win/over paths call calcRank which does everything. So:
- over (hp branch): calcRank() covers saving
- over normal: calcRank()
- win: calcRank()

