parts.text:
Now `afterGame` — make all modes independent: win → back to level, lose → restart same mode. Currently:

```js
  afterGame() {
    if (this.state === 1) {
      if (this.level === 2) this.hp = 3
      this.buildBricks()
      this.resetBall()
    } else if (this.state === 2) {
      if (this.level < 3) {
        this.level++
        this.updateModeFlags()
        this.buildBricks()
        this.resetBall()
        if (this.level === 2) this.hp = 3
      } else {
        if (this.timer) { clearInterval(this.timer); this.timer = null }
        try { sensor.unsubscribeAccelerometer() } catch (e) {}
        router.back()
      }
    }
  }
```

New:
```js
  afterGame() {
    if (this.state === 1) {
      if (this.isHp) this.hp = 3
      this.buildBricks()
      this.resetBall()
    } else if (this.state === 2) {
      if (this.timer) { clearInterval(this.timer); this.timer = null }
      try { sensor.unsubscribeAccelerometer() } catch (e) {}
      router.back()
    }
  }
```

